intrinsic warning that you get as a wizard at level 15 ("You feel
sensitive").  other characters get this also and it may also be
obtained by a ring of warning.

it is useless, IMO, because the warning factors in monster level vs.
your level.  at level 15, that's somewhat pointless but the greater
problem is that the effect is completely non-intuitive!  warning
should be a sort of radar, IMO.  a white glow should mean a sewer
rat (or similar useless monster) is in the vicinity and approaching.
a black glow should always mean a nasty monster (named demon, dragon,
etc.) is in the vicinity and approaching.  wearing gloves should
hide the effect.

